{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">羅馬尼亞有農民上街，要求當局推翻歐盟進口活羊禁令，示威演變成警民衝突。警方指憲兵在內逾20人傷，多人被扣查。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大約3,000名農民及牧羊人響應右翼組織號召，周二在首都布加勒斯特的政府大樓外集會，期間有人向警方投擲石塊及雜物，警方施放催淚汽體驅散群眾。總統達恩在社交平台發文，形容事件極端暴力，不滿有人試圖將合法示威演變成街頭打鬥。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ROM.PROTEST-0130_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026n7bdqLaat71789515625.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.ROM.PROTEST-0130_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">觸發農民示威原因是歐盟為了阻止羊瘟擴散，將羅馬尼亞的出口活羊禁令期限延長到本年底。有牧羊人及農民擔心影響生計，並批評歐盟在羅馬尼亞全國實施禁令，而不是受疫情影響地區。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ROM.PROTEST-0130_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20263JmefH3fnL1789515646.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.ROM.PROTEST-0130_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T01:43:54.370721+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}